  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Thinly slice the zucchini. Reserve a few whole leaves, then coarsely chop the mint, discarding the stems. Crush or finely chop 2 garlic cloves.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1450066/photos/large/prep_ingredients-343e749e92fda23c05c0f74563cdae00.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Brown mince: Heat 2 tsp olive oil in a medium deep frypan over medium-high heat. Cook the plant-based mince, breaking up the lumps with a spoon, for 5-6 mins until browned. Remove from the pan with a slotted spoon.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1450067/photos/large/fry_lamb-02d405384308611f6e550f4bd306e11f.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook zucchini: Return the pan to medium heat. Cook the zucchini, stirring, for 4 mins or until just tender. Add the mince, garlic and chermoula spice blend and cook, stirring, for 30 secs or until fragrant. Season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1450068/photos/large/fry_zucchini-64c34f4c8e0adf13d7f930bd306d8bc3.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add couscous: Stir the couscous and 200ml boiling water into the mince mixture. Cover and remove the pan from the heat. Stand for 5 mins or until the water is absorbed. Fluff with a fork. Stir in half the chopped mint. Taste, then season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1450069/photos/large/add_couscous-2ba9e1480fd9ed7bbbcab2d631edb060.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Combine the yoghurt, remaining chopped mint and 1 tsp red wine vinegar in a bowl. Divide the couscous pilaf among bowls and top with the mint yoghurt and reserved mint leaves. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1450070/photos/large/serve_up-486f0929069bf1c07a4a57c3f0b09952.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make it yours: If you have some on hand, scatter over some toasted pepitas or slivered almonds for crunch.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1450071/photos/large/make_it_yours-5ce41fec3c1d74f079aacb5521d8bd84.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
